cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Tianyige Ming Examination Records: Full Text and English Translation"
abstract: >-
  Machine transcription, punctuation and English translation of 312 printed records of the
  Ming civil-service examinations (1371-1684) digitized by the Tianyi Pavilion Museum
  (天一閣博物院): 40,461 page images, about 9.9 million characters. Each record is also split
  into documents (prefaces, officials, 12,921 questions, 49,378 graduates, and 7,348 model
  answers with the examiners' comments).
authors:
